---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
description: "Notes and longer pieces, written and tended on this site."
permalink: /writing/
pageStyles:
  - /assets/css/figures.css
---
{#- The Writing room: how writing works here, the newest three, then every
    piece by type (eleventy.config.js → groupWriting), the stage key, the
    tags, and the garden row when _data/writing.json says to show it. -#}
{%- set wr = collections.writing | groupWriting %}
{% set mastheadLabel = "writing/" %}
{% set mastheadLede %}Notes and longer pieces, written and tended here. Notes are short and often unfinished, so each one says how far along it is.{% endset %}
{% include "masthead.njk" %}

<figure class="fig fig--stages" aria-labelledby="fig-stages-title">
  <p class="fig__title" id="fig-stages-title">How writing works here</p>
  <ol class="stages" aria-label="One note, from first pass to settled">
    <li class="stages__step"><span class="chip chip--seedling" aria-hidden="true">a note</span><span class="stages__word">a first pass<span class="sr-only">, seedling</span></span></li>
    <li class="stages__step"><span class="chip chip--budding" aria-hidden="true">a note</span><span class="stages__word">reworked<span class="sr-only">, budding</span></span></li>
    <li class="stages__step"><span class="chip chip--evergreen" aria-hidden="true">a note</span><span class="stages__word">settled<span class="sr-only">, evergreen</span></span></li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>A note lands here the day it's written, marked as a seedling, from a phone, in one tap. When it's reworked it changes its mark, not its colour. A few settle.</figcaption>
</figure>

{%- if wr.total %}
{#- The newest three repeat entries from the index below, so they carry no
    microformats (rowPlain); the h-feed holds each piece once. -#}
<section class="writing-block" aria-labelledby="writing-newest">
  <h2 class="eyebrow" id="writing-newest">Newest</h2>
  <div class="index-table">
    {%- set rowPlain = true %}
    {%- for post in collections.writing.slice(0, 3) %}
    {%- include "writing-row.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- set rowPlain = false %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="h-feed" aria-labelledby="writing-feed-heading">
  <span class="p-name sr-only" id="writing-feed-heading">Writing</span>
  {%- for wrGroup in [["notes", "notes/"], ["essays", "essays/"], ["evolving", "evolving/"]] %}
  {%- set wrItems = wr[wrGroup[0]] %}
  {%- if wrItems.length %}
  <div class="writing-block">
    <h2 class="eyebrow" id="writing-{{ wrGroup[0] }}">{{ wrGroup[1] }}</h2>
    <div class="index-table">
      {#- Over 12 rows that span more than one year, a mono year label opens
          each year. Rows are newest first, so the first and last rows'
          years tell whether the group spans more than one. -#}
      {%- set wrSplit = wrItems.length > 12 and wrItems[0].date.getUTCFullYear() != wrItems[wrItems.length - 1].date.getUTCFullYear() %}
      {%- for post in wrItems %}
      {%- if wrSplit and (loop.first or post.date.getUTCFullYear() != wrItems[loop.index0 - 1].date.getUTCFullYear()) %}
      <p class="writing-year">{{ post.date.getUTCFullYear() }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- include "writing-row.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
{%- endif %}

<p class="writing-key">
  <span class="eyebrow">How far along</span>
  <span><strong>seedling</strong> a first pass &middot; <strong>budding</strong> reworked &middot; <strong>evergreen</strong> settled</span>
</p>

{%- if collections.tagList and collections.tagList.length %}
<p class="tag-browse">
  Browse by tag:
  {%- for tag in collections.tagList %}
  {% if loop.index0 > 0 %}&middot;{% endif %}
  <a href="/writing/tags/{{ tag | slug }}/">{{ tag }}</a>
  {%- endfor %}
</p>
{%- endif %}

{%- if writing.elsewhere.show %}
{#- The garden slot (_data/writing.json): one row, off-site. -#}
<div class="index-table">
  <div class="index-row">
    <span class="index-row__label">{{ writing.elsewhere.label }}</span>
    <span class="index-row__desc"><a href="{{ writing.elsewhere.url }}">{{ writing.elsewhere.text }}</a></span>
    <span class="index-row__meta">{{ writing.elsewhere.url | hostname }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></span>
  </div>
</div>
{%- endif %}
